Yes, if one frames it as a statement about expected predictive error, one can make statements about the probability that model A will outperform model B.  Aki and I played around with some of these ideas when writing the Waic paper; maybe we should come back to it.  The short answer is that it should be possible to make these comparisons directly using the data.
A

