Thanks for your help!

n_leapfrog__ is mostly at 2047, n_divergent__ is always 0.
I don't really know what I could try to reformulate my model. Could you give me any hints?
It's mainly this discontinuous function (partly linear, partly exponential), so
it's derivative might be diverge at one point.

My other similar, but continuous models range between 1 and 30 for n_leapfrog__,
and have values of 1 and 0 for n_divergent.

