Subject: Re: [stan-users] Warning about transformed left-hand-side, in censoring model
Message-ID: <IGEPxrKJkt4.DQnEmBx-bEkJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <IGEPxrKJkt4.OV6pluIVTrsJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
