Subject: Re: [stan-users] A few ideas for future versions...
Message-ID: <Dfa_mV3MyXA.aLrVrc3XWUMJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <Dfa_mV3MyXA.HsBjubW0VY8J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <Dfa_mV3MyXA.ng_qX3_XFv0J@stan-users.groups.google.com> <Dfa_mV3MyXA.HsBjubW0VY8J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
