From u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com  Thu Sep 25 19:54:11 2014
From: u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com (Bob Carpenter)
Date: Thu, 25 Sep 2014 19:54:11 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] An IT Question: Running Stan on massively parallel platforms
Message-ID: <HdFOgviKFKE.dg_3H1pQErEJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <HdFOgviKFKE.H90vuBOjj_UJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <HdFOgviKFKE.HFumCUM-gs0J@stan-users.groups.google.com> <HdFOgviKFKE.H90vuBOjj_UJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
