Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/F9a07ImLyHk/m/6fh2rwJvn_sJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

OK it seems like I had a bug in the code (nothing new there then).

        increment_log_prob(-poisson_log(counts[heldout[n]],
                                        rates[heldout[n]]));

should be

        increment_log_prob(-poisson_log(counts[n, heldout[n]],
                                        rates[heldout[n]]));

Sorry for the noise but any comments on whether this technique is worthwhile from an efficiency standpoint would be welcome.

Regards,
John.

