Hi Charles,

You'll need to declare your parameters as vectors, not arrays. There's a chapter in the manual describing the difference. (I'm on my phone and it's hard to look it up.)

Instead of
real<lower=0> alpha1[3];
use
vector<lower=0>[3] alpha1;

